{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## Tool Use\n\nUse the provided tool `extracted_data` to extract correct and accurate structured data from the input.\n\nTool purpose: Function call based on user instructions.\n\nCall the tool with the best supported arguments for the requested extraction."},{"role":"user","content":"Score the response to the query. Output only the grade.\n<query>\nBetty needs $100; has half; parents give $15; grandparents twice parents. How much more needed?\n<\/query>\n<response>\nChain: Betty needs $100 and has half, so she has $50. Parents give $15, and grandparents give twice that, $30. Total available is $50 + $15 + $30 = $95, leaving $5 needed.\nAnswer: 5\n<\/response>"}],"max_completion_tokens":1024,"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data","description":"Function call based on user instructions.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"grade":{"type":"string","enum":["Poor","Average","Good","Excellent"]}},"required":["grade"],"additionalProperties":false}}}],"tool_choice":{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data"}},"reasoning_effort":"none"}